OL,3,GNEWSAOutfall pipe repaired after sewage
OL,4,Apumped into sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outfall pipe has been repaired and
OL,7,Fis now operating as normal, after drone
OL,8,Ffilm footage revealed it was
OL,9,Fdischarging sewage too close to the
OL,10,Fshore.
OL,12,FWork was completed on 28 October by the
OL,13,FGuernsey Ports' dive team, who used a
OL,14,Ffavourable tide time to install the
OL,15,Fpipe at Fort George.
OL,17,FGuernsey Water said the dive team would
OL,18,Fneed to make additional visits to
OL,19,Ffinish works to concrete block
OL,20,Fprotection around the pipe.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
