OL,3,GNEWSAOutfall pipe repaired after sewage
OL,4,Apumped into sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts capital delivery manager Carl Falla
OL,7,Fsaid: "Since being made aware of the
OL,8,Fbroken pipe, teams from Guernsey Water
OL,9,Fand Guernsey Ports have been hard at
OL,10,Fwork behind the scenes to identify the
OL,11,Fquickest and safest way to remove the
OL,12,Fold broken pipe and install the new
OL,13,Fone. "
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
